<p style="text-align: left;">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect. This is the <em>y</em>-coordinate of the <em>y</em>-intercept of line <math alttext="k"><mi>k</mi>
